		                    c0-0.6,0.4-1,1-1h1V5C5,3.3,6.3,2,8,2z M12,7H4v6h8V7z M8,8.3c0.3,0,0.5,0.1,0.7,0.3C8.8,8.8,8.9,9,8.9,9.2c0,0.3-0.1,0.6-0.4,0.8
